   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Days",
     "texto": [
      "Days are written with a **lowercase** letter. **Lunedì** on its own means «Monday» (a particular one). With the article, **il lunedì**, it means «Mondays» (every one).",
      "They are all masculine except **la domenica**.",
      "**Oggi** = today. **Il fine settimana** = the weekend."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "The days of the week",
