     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Frequency",
     "texto": [
      "**Sempre** (always), **spesso** (often) and **qualche volta** (sometimes). Short adverbs usually go **after the verb**: **Vado spesso al cinema**.",
      "«Never» is **non … mai**, around the verb: **Non lavoro mai la domenica**."
     ],
